Subject: [PATCH] tas2555: bound firmware parsing and clean up allocations

Use a checked reader for descriptions, section counts and command data,
validate bulk command lengths and configuration references, handle
allocation failures, and release parsed data during probe cleanup.

Upstream-Status: Pending

